tion, I remain inclined to keep Candidate\u202fB as my provisional recommendation, but only if we can confirm that B\u2019s teamwork issues are manageable. I propose we ask Agent\u202f1 for a concrete example of B\u2019s crew\u2011cooperation behavior in a past flight crew, to see whether the grumpiness translates into a safety risk."}
